<p>Watch my 3MT Finals <a href="https://media.unh.edu/media/Reecha%20Acharya%20-%20UNH%203MT%20Finals%202023/1_1n8jxhn0">here</a></p>

<p>Participation in 3-Minute Thesis Competition was my first attempt in science communication. This was an awakening experience for me with a realization of how hard it is to communicate your scientific research to a general audience. I am thankful to UNH Graduate School and organizers for this experience. One of my best memories of being at University of New Hampshire.</p>

